&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 30 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Paralegal based in London to play a key role in supporting Verifone&#39;s international legal function. The successful candidate will manage corporate entity governance activities across multiple jurisdictions, assist with commercial contract review and administration, support regulatory and compliance initiatives, and serve as a trusted resource for lawyers and business stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role requiring strong organizational skills, sound judgment, attention to detail, and the ability to work independently in a fast-paced global environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Required Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A successful candidate will be able to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day administration of Verifone&#39;s global portfolio of legal entities, with a focus on EMEA entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate annual corporate maintenance requirements, including director and officer appointments, board and shareholder approvals, statutory filings, powers of attorney, and corporate recordkeeping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with corporate secretarial service providers and internal stakeholders regarding governance matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain corporate records, minute books, organizational charts, and entity management databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support legal entity formations, restructurings, mergers, liquidations, and other corporate transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, draft, and negotiate routine commercial agreements under attorney supervision, including:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Non-disclosure agreements (NDAs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer forms and standard commercial contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amendments, renewals, and statements of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support implementation and administration of contract lifecycle management processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate legal requests and inquiries from internal business partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to process improvements that enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of the legal function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Required Experience and Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A successful candidate will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 10 years of paralegal, corporate governance, legal operations, or related legal experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting corporate entities across multiple jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong familiarity with corporate governance requirements and entity management practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing and administering NDAs and other routine commercial agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and deadlines with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail and commitment to accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with AI tools, Microsoft Office applications, and legal technology tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a multinational or international company with operations across Europe and other regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Business Analytics Intern at Picnic, you’ll be at the forefront of international innovation, tackling complex challenges with fresh, groundbreaking solutions. This dual-location role is all about driving impact. You&#39;ll analyze data, help identify opportunities, and support strategies that redefine the grocery shopping experience across Europe. Throughout this year-long program, you’ll exchange between two locations &lt;strong&gt;Paris (6 months) &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;Amsterdam (6 months)&lt;/strong&gt;, gaining cross-market perspectives in a fast-paced environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solving real-life puzzles: &lt;/strong&gt;Tackle critical business questions that shape Picnic’s business model every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enabling: &lt;/strong&gt;Achieve operational excellence by approaching challenges with a data-driven and analytical mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and optimize models for real-time improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicating: &lt;/strong&gt;Work effectively with different teams to deliver impactful and sustainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning your projects&lt;/strong&gt;: Take initiative by challenging the status-quo. Just because it’s been done that way doesn’t mean it’s the best way. Try us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently pursuing a &lt;strong&gt;Master’s&lt;/strong&gt; in a Quantitative field&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with &lt;strong&gt;SQL and Python&lt;/strong&gt; or similar programming languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to hold fluent presentations both in &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;French&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an&lt;strong&gt; EU citizenship&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are available for &lt;strong&gt;12 months&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your Internship performance, we can discuss further opportunities for a full-time role at Picnic!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💪Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧑‍🎓Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work in an awesome scaleup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎓Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📌Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer a gross salary of €1,500 per month in Paris and €800 per month in Amsterdam for a full-time internship.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note&lt;/strong&gt;: You will need to &lt;strong&gt;secure your own housing&lt;/strong&gt; in both Amsterdam and Paris, though our team is happy to share local tips and guidance to help with your search!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are the strategic mastermind behind the digital connectivity of our enterprise clients. As a Senior Integration Consultant, you don&#39;t just build interfaces; you define the integration architecture for massive automotive and financial ecosystems. You operate at the highest level of technical complexity, ensuring that &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Miles&lt;/strong&gt;&quot; serves as the beating heart of a connected landscape. In this high-impact role at a hidden champion of mobility tech, you act as a technical authority, a trusted advisor to client CIOs, and a mentor who elevates the entire integration practice within Sofico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You take full architectural ownership of large-scale integration projects, designing resilient, high-volume data exchange ecosystems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You act as a strategic advisor to our clients&#39; IT leadership, guiding them through complex decisions regarding API strategies and system decoupling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You define and enforce integration best practices and standards, ensuring consistency and quality across multiple projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You serve as the ultimate escalation point for the most critical and complex technical challenges, solving problems others cannot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You lead and mentor a team of integration consultants, fostering a culture of technical excellence and continuous innovation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You collaborate directly with our R&amp;amp;D department to shape the future of our core integration framework based on real-world enterprise needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your skills and interests:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have an extensive track record in software architecture and system integration, ideally within the financial or automotive sector&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You possess mastery of integration patterns (e.g., SOA, Microservices, Event-Driven Architecture) and technologies (Java, REST, SOAP, Kafka, Camel)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are driven by the challenge of orchestrating complex IT landscapes and have a vision for how modern systems should communicate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have proven experience in technical leadership, enjoying the role of a mentor and knowledge multiplier&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You communicate with authority and clarity, capable of convincing C-level stakeholders of your technical vision&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are fluent in German and English and thrive in a role where you can set the direction rather than just following the path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico, you’ll join an international, multicultural company with over 30 years of success. We double in size every five years, staying true to our open and collaborative culture even as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe you should be in control of your own career. That’s why we put your personal development first. With an extensive onboarding program, you’ll spend six months learning our products and getting to know the organization with the support of a dedicated job coach. Your learning doesn’t stop there; we’ll continue to offer opportunities for growth and development throughout your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in a modern, accessible office with flexible and hybrid work options that allow you to balance work and life. In addition, we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours and the option to work from home. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Employee discounts, eGym Wellpass, Bike Leasing and a subsidized Jobticket for public transportation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Company pension scheme with optional additional occupational disability insurance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Growth potential through personalized learning and development plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A vibrant team culture with regular team events and a company weekend. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Großer Markt, perfektes Timing: Deine Verantwortung&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Der deutsche Gesundheitsmarkt befindet sich an einem entscheidenden Wendepunkt – und Du digitalisierst ihn, Praxis für Praxis. Als &lt;strong&gt;Account Executive (x/f/m) in Berlin &lt;/strong&gt;führst Du Dein Territory wie ein eigenes Business und bringst mit unserer KI-gestützten All-in-One Lösung echten Mehrwert direkt in den Praxisalltag. Die Chance, die vor uns liegt, ist noch weit größer als das, was wir bisher aufgebaut haben.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eigenverantwortlicher Vertrieb:&lt;/strong&gt; Du begleitest den gesamten Sales-Prozess – von der ersten Kontaktaufnahme bis zum erfolgreichen Abschluss&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Umsatz &amp;amp; Wachstum:&lt;/strong&gt; Du bist verantwortlich für Deine Pipeline, den Umsatz (MRR), Beziehungen und das Wachstum in Deiner Region&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kundenzentrierte Beratung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du analysierst die Bedürfnisse von Ärzt:innen, verstehst ihre Herausforderungen und begeisterst sie mit unserer digitalen Lösung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Datengetriebene Erfolgsmessung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du trackst Deine Performance regelmäßig mit Salesforce und nutzt Daten für eine gezielte Vertriebsstrategie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
